<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2TI - Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus sẽkoo au pɛsiyɛ yɛnɛ TIMOTI Bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus sẽkoo au pɛsiyɛ yɛnɛ Timoti Bi</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Bulus sẽkoo au pɛsi beenɛ yɛnɛ Timoti bi </char> nwanya ba aru Timoti bimasinɛ aru upɛ u shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ au vishonɛ. Gaanɛ yuruu ukɔ ɔrɛ sisɨnmɛɛnɛ Timoti kpaa bimasinɛ aru u ɔ̃ shɔshinɛkɨnti e sisɨn ãnɛ aka Yesɔ Kirisi bi, u sã ruu tɔ̃vɨn matinɛ a rumanɛ gbaali, u pɛliu vishonɛ naa shɔmala woson naa shɔ nyawanɛ, u pɛli vim kpai a tete raɓoonɛ a shɔ ayi bɛ̃u nyanwanɛ yɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shɔ gɔ̃ Timoti yushotɔ badijo aru viuyɛ n-tiu yukɔnɛ a nyamasinɛ ruukɔ̃linɛ au lɛsi shɔyi weshɔ ɗɔnyɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shɔ kpaari Timoti sisɨntɔ a shɔvi beenɛyi ɔ̃nɛ ai vishonɛ, sisɨn ãnɛ, sisɨnmɛɛnɛ, ɔrinɛ, sisɨnmanɛ, a raɓoonɛni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛlinɛ a bimasinɛ (1.3-2.13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bimasinɛ a yushogɔ̃nɛ (2.14-4.5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nogbete Bulus kpau yuuyɛ (4.6-18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisinɛ (4.19-22)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Nkɔ Bulus Kirisi Yesɔ Jashonɛ beerɔɔmi sẽkoomrɛ a Ɗalapa kasinɛni, Ɗalapa shonrɛ nɛn nwari shɔ ruu suru au ɔ̃ dangdang gbeteu ma nɛn ã shɔ aka Kirisi Yesɔ kabii.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Yɛnɛ Timoti majaa gbete n ɔriyɛ ɗɔbiiː</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa uɓeye a Kirisi Yesɔ Uɓeyelapa u ãwɔ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ, u ntawɔ raatɔ, a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Ɗa gakinɛ dɔ̃rinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />N dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa shɔ gbete n basiuyɛtɛ, nagbete maruyi pɛli si a sisɨn gbete yɛ, n dɔ̃riutɛ nɔgbete n kpaasisɨntɔ n gakɔɔ Ɗa kopileepiya zɨmba a niti ni. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />N kɛ kpaasisɨn nɛ aa muruni, n kasaa zɛnɛtɛ fɛ̃ɛm, aru n kpaa ɔ̃nɛ atette sisɨn puru. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />N kpaasisɨntɛ a sisɨn-ãnɛ gbete a wunini, zɔng sisɨn-ãnɛ gbete mɛtara mini Loyi a mini Yunasi u sɔ̃njo a wunini. N ãsisɨntɛ a sɔ̃nji a wunini. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Arumkɔ n kpaarɔɔsisɨn ɔ pɔ̃ Ɗa vi-ãnɛ u ɔ̃ suruni naa nkɛ pɔsɔɔ naa nɛ a yuu yɛni. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Aruviya suru gbete Ɗalapa a wuyɛ ji pɔ̃uɓa u ɔ̃ shɔsetiyi ɓa ama ãu suru au kaka, a ɔrinɛ, a yuusãnɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Mokaa ntayusẽ shinɛ nɛ ayuu Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisini, ko ang yuu mokaa ntayusẽnɛ, nkɔng shɔgbete shɔ mang a Kirisi yuu, nɔgbete a si pɛli nam a masisɨntɔ a raɓoonɛni aru ruu tɔ̃vɨnmi, Ɗalapa yɛ ãwɔ kaka tɔ au yuuni. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Ɗalapa raautɛ a ɓaunyarɛ nɛu ɔ̃ n shɔbii, ji ɓau nyaɓa ayuu vigbete u pɛliyɛ tɔ̃vɨn ɓa, ama ji ayuu ruu gbete pɔ̃ au sisɨnyɛ a tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ. Ɗalapa ãu tɔ̃vɨn shonɛm a nyaba Kirisi Yesɔ kabii, koo u ɓɛɛ shɛnɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />Ama dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa tasiutɛ a nyaba u shɔshɔranɛ anɛ Kirisi Yesɔ. Ukɔ pɔ̃ ruu vɔnɛrɛ kagbete, a tasiu ɗɔsẽsẽ ruu suru kpaanɛ a nyaba ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete yisinyaɓayɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Ɗalapa lɔntɛ nɛn ɔ̃ jashonɛ a shɔmala nɛn nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />pɛ ji a ruu vimkɔ n ɓoorarɛ. Ama n kaka dooɗɔ lakinɛ fɛ̃ɛm, aruviya n zɛ shɔ gbete n ãsisɨn au biini tɛttɔ, n zɛ tɛttɔ yɛ zɛnɔtɔ u sã vigbete ang ãu a naa tɔ̃vɨn anɛ leeukɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete n mataayɛ a sãtɔ fɛ̃ɛm, u ɔkɛ vitasinɛ aa ɗɔbii gbete a gɨnyɛ, a ɔ̃ a ɓuzɨn sisɨn-ãnɛ a ɔrinɛ gbete pɛu ɓɛɛ aka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />A nyaba Ɗa suru kaka gbete u ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a ukɔni, ɔ shitɔ ayuu vitɔ̃vɨng gbete Ɗalapa ãwɔ a naani.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />A zɛ tɛttɔ nɛ kopiya a Tipi Asiya risin kntitɛ, piti a paijelu a Hamojeni ni. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa u nta Onɛsiporu shɔwɛrɛyi raatɔ, aru kopileepiya masinbiitɔ. Ji ntausẽɓa nɛn a jahmni ɓa, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Ama naa to Roomatɛ tɛ̃ɛti, a gaakɛ n kãanɛ a kpang pɛgotɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Ɗalapa u ntau raatɔ a leeuniǃ Ɔ zɛtɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm vigbete pɛlin a Apisa yɛni.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kirisi Yesɔ Soja tɔ̃vɨn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Mɔkɔ Timoti majaa yɛ ɗekɨntɔ a kaka u ɔ̃ ɗɔn a nyaɓa Kirisi Yesɔ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛni. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Vimatinɛ gbete ɔ ntayɛ ang nwari shɔ a shɔshinɛkɨnti waanɛ i ɗekɨn ɔ tɛttɔ, n kasirɛ ɔ n ti shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ, shɔ gbeteyi i yɛ zɛnɔɔ shɔwɔyi vimatinɛ sɔ̃njiyɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />A ɓooraatɔ a ukɔni, naa Kirisi Yesɔ soja tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Soja gbeteu ɗɔ vishonɛ pɛlinɛ fɛ̃ɛm au kasinɛn yupɛ̃ni u bɛlintɔ vãsi vishonɛ pɛlinɛ ɓa naa tottoni ɓa. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Jinankɔ naa shɔwɔ kɛ pɔ̃ yuunɛ a shoshɛnɛni Ɗa yɛ sharuuɓa setɛ gɨntɛ jo nya-ãsinɛ shoshɛnɛukɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Shɔjalanɛ au pɛlivishonɛtɛ fɛ̃ɛm ukɔ kpaa visha a shɔ gaa yeenɛ a jaa pɛjo. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />A lɛripɛ a vigbete n ɗɔ shanɛm, aruviya Uɓeyelapa yɛ zɛnɔɔtɔ u pɔ̃saanaa a zɛ vim piti kpai.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Kopiɗaviya a kpaasisɨnpɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi bi, shɔgbete shɔ yusu a saa a suruni, u pɛ a Dauda laduru, ji naa gbete ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete n nwarɔɔ mati shɔyɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Aruviya n nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn n ɓooraatɔ, shɔ mang a jaahɨm naa shɔ ruuvini. Ama Ɗanyaruubii shɔ mau dɔɔ ji ɓa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Aru nankɔ ko-iviya n mɛɛsisɨntɔ aru shɔ gbete Ɗalapa lɔyiyɛ, nɔgbeteyi ikɔma i kpaa raanɛ jo aka Kirisi Yesɔ a bassinɛ gbete sɔ̃nnyaɓayɛni. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Shom pɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn a shɔ shanɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">&lt;&lt;U kɛ vɔnɛ a ukɔni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">u yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃nji a ukɔni.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />U kɛ yɛ ɗeknnɛ a sisɨnmɛɛnɛni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">u yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo lakpati a ukɔni nyazɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">u kɛ masiunyanɛ nɛ u ji zɛu nii ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">yɛ masiunya sɔ̃njo nɛn ji zɛu nii ɓa.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />U sisɨn ãnɛ ji ɔ̃ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">U sisɨn ãnɛ ɓɛɛ aɗɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">aruviya yɛ yeeriu yuu nya ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔvishonɛ gbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃naatɛ au yuuniyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Timoti a kpaari shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ sisɨntɔ a vimni, a gɔ̃yi yushotɔ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ikɔyi waabanɛ ayuu ruuyini aruviya n ti shɔ vitɔ̃vɨng ɓa ama lɛsi shɔ gbeteyi wesho a ɗɔnnitɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />A pɛlivishonɛ fɛ̃ɛm nɔgbete akɛ tasaa yuunɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, yɛ shanɛ nnbee, a ɔ̃ naa shɔ vishonɛ au pɛlivishonɛ fɛ̃ɛm ntayusẽɓa au vishonɛni ɓa, shɔ gbete mati shɔ ruu Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Mɔkaa nwali ruu gbete a shɔ ntaseti ɓa a ruukɔ̃linɛ au pɔ̃rɛ shɔ bassi Ɗalapa ɓa, aruviya shɔ gbeteyi pɛli viwa i yiki shɔzɛ kpɛlɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiini. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />I vimatinɛm raaɗɔmɛɛli naa nɔrɔ bi au pũtɛ shaa biiyɛ. Shɔzɛ ziti ai mati shɔ vimi ikɔi ɔ̃rɛ Himeniyu a Filetu, <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />I yaa nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ tɔ̃vɨntɛ, i shanɛ Ɗalapa yusi shɔtɛ gboti a saani aru nankɔ i pɔ̃ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyitɛ i yaa sisɨn ãnɛtɛ a Kirisi vimatinɛni. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Ama Ɗalapa dɔjaa u kaka aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm zɨnti ɓa; a dɔjaankɔ Ɗalapa bee ruumrɛ nɛ:&lt;&lt;Uɓyelapa zɛ u ɓɛɛyɛ tɛttɔ.&gt;&gt; a &lt;&lt;Shɔ gbeteyi shanɛ nɛi pɛ Uɓeyelapa ɓɛɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng ɔkɔrɔ i yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />A wɛrɛ pɛ̃niba ɓariyi aɗɔn a piiyini tottot, gãsiyi shɔ pɛli tarimɛɛ a siliva, wɔɔyi a laawaati a tɔ̃pɔ̃; gãsiyi shɔ pɛli aru vishonɛ pɛ̃niba wɔɔyi aru jaa vishonɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Vim ɔ̃ ji nankɔ a shɔzɛni, shɔ gbeteyi ikɛ sɔyi yuunɛ a vikɔ̃linɛni kpai, i yɛ ɔ̃ naa vigbeteyi shɔ lɔyɛyi aru vishonɛ pɛ̃niba aruviya ikɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ shɔvi yɛ pɛlivishonɛtɔ awuni, aɗɔ pɔ̃nɛ aru ko-pi vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn shopiya shɔ pɛlitɔ awuni. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />A yaa vikɔ̃linɛyi gbete gãsi jakasa i kasi pɛlinɛtɔ, a pɔ̃ sisɨn a pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng, sisɨn ãnɛ, ɔrinɛ, a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ, a shɔ gbeteyi ɓaa Uɓeyelapa nya a sisɨn gbete u pɔ̃siyinaayɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Ama shɔu kɛ masinyanɛ ayuu vikɔ̃linɛ a vigbete ɓa viwɔ ɓa, a yuutɔ ɗɔn; a zɛ tɛttɔ yɛ yisinya a bawaanɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Shɔ gbete pɛli Uɓeyelapa vishonɛ ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng ɔkɔrɔ u waaba ɓa, ama ɔ̃ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a kopiya ɗɔbii, shɔmala tɔ̃vɨn au sisɨnmɛɛnɛ a ɗɔnni. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a ɔkɔrɔ u tɔ̃ri u shɔ nɔpɔ̃tɔ, aru wɔɔɓa Ɗalapa yɛ yaasi nyabatɔ i kɔsi sisɨn i yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛ i zɛ tɔ̃vɨn aru Kirisi. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Kɛɗɔn i kɛ sɔɔ kɛnɛ ai sẽrẽyini, i ranaa kɛkn a tari gbete shɔ-shɔɗakinɛ ɗayɛni, shɔgbete sãyitɛttɔ pɔ̃yitɛ i pɛli vigbete kasinɛ i pɛliyɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔzɛ vipɛlinɛ a lee Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Ɔ kpaasisɨntɔ a lee gbete koo yisinyayɛ shɔ yɛ ɓooraatɔ fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Shɔzɛyi yɛ ɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi kɔyi yuukɔ sheeli, shɔzɛyi i yɛ ɔ̃ shɔ saa kasinɛyi, i nwanya a vi pɛ̃niba gbeteyi pɛliyɛ, shɔzɛyi yɛ ɔ̃ shɔ yuuɗenɛyi, i yɛ ɔ̃ shɔ shɔ dãlinɛyi, shɔgbeteyi i bɛ̃ɛ̃ ɓeye a ɓiniyi nyagɨnnɛyɛ, i ɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi bassi Ɗalapa ɓayɛ; <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />shɔzɛyi yɛ ɔ̃ shɔ gbeteyi ɔri shɔwɔyi ɓa, i yɛ ɔ̃ shɔ zɔ sãnɛ a sisɨn, shɔ nyayeelinɛyi, shɔgbeteyi sãyi yuu dɔɔɓa, shɔgbeteyi i lɛsi shɔwɔyi sisɨnyɛ, i yɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ vi tɔ̃vɨntɔ; <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />shɔgbeteyi mɛli i shɔbiiyi ai nɔpɔ̃yi naa, shɔgbeteyi i laaɓa yuuni ɓa, i yɛ pɔ̃ ai sisɨn nɛi tɛɛ shɔwɔyitɛ kpai; i yɛ ɔri ba vigbete i nta tɔ̃vɨn aɗɔn u tɛɛ Ɗalapa ɔrinɛtɔ; <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />a ɓili i tasi nɛi shɔ Ɗalapa bassinɛ, ama i bɛ̃ɛ kaka gaanɛ gbete yɛ tɔ̃riyi ɔ̃nɛ vipɛlinɛ kɔ̃linɛtɔ. Ɔkɔɔ radɔɔnɛ zɔng shɔɗɔmiyini. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Zɔ gãsiyi ai tetteni i toli shɔ wɛrɛ-wɛrɛ i ɗaki su gbeteyi kpɛ̃ ruu ɓayɛ, shɔ gbete ruuvini shayi kaka bitɛyɛ, zɔng vikɔ̃linɛ kasi totto sãyi yuutɛttɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />su ɗɔmiyi i mativitɔ kopiɗaviya ama i zɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn ayuu Kirisi ɓa. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Ji nagbete Yannes a Yambres i masinya a Musa yɛ, ji nankɔ shɔmiyi masinya a ruu tɔ̃vɨn, shɔgbeteyi lɛrinɛ ɓɛɛ jo kɔ̃linɛ ai sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ama i yɛ ɗekɨn kpɛlɛ ɓa, aruviya i rãng pɛlinɛ shɔ yɛ zɛtɔ ji naa gbete shɔ zɛ Yannes a Yambres i ɓɛɛyɛ.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyakosinɛ Dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Ama mɔkɔ Timoti a zɛ vigbete n mati shɔ tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm, a zɛ nɔgbete n ɔ̃ yɛ tɛttɔ, a zɛn vigbeten kasi pɛlinɛ ang ɔ̃nɛ tɛttɔ, ang sisɨn ãnɛni, ang sisɨnmɛɛnɛni, n ɔrinɛ, ang sisɨnmɛɛnɛ dɔkɔkɔni, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />A zɛ tɛttɔ shɔ tasin raatɛ a raaɓoonɛ gbete kpang-yɛni. A zɛ vigbete kpang a Antakiya tɛ, a Ikoniya a Listira, zɔng raaɓoonɛ gbete n ɓooyɛǃ Ama a shomni kpai Uɓeyelapa raantɔ a ɓuzɨn ni. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Shɔgbete kasi zɔng ɔ̃nɛ naa Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ aka Kirisi Yesɔ seetɛ shɔ tasiu raatɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Ama shɔ kɔ̃linɛyi a shɔ-shɔɗakinɛyi yɛ pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ i ɗekɨnɗekɨn a pɛlinɛni u tɛɛ kaka. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Ama a yɛ ɗekɨn ɓɛɛtɔ a vitɔ̃vɨng gbete a matiyɛni, a ãsisɨn tɛttɔ nɛ pɛ nizɛ, aruviya a zɛ shɔ gbete a mati vi ai ɗɔbii tɛttɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />A kpaasisɨn tɛttɔ aɗagbete si adoo jujaa a zɛ labeenɛ Ɗa nyaruubi wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ yɛtɛ, au ãa sẽrẽ gbete pɔ̃rɛ a kpaa raanɛ aka sisɨn ãnɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ bi. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Laabeenɛ Ɗanyaruubii kpai pɛ ruu gbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃ a shɔ gbete beeyɛ sisɨn u vishonɛ aɗɔn, a nyaba shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn matinɛ, shɔ geli shɔzɛ nɛ vigbete i pɛliyɛ pɛ vikɔ̃linɛ, shɔ tɔ̃ri ruukɔ̃linɛyi, wɔsɔ̃n nyakɔsinɛ nɔgbete shɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn yɛ, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />nɔgbete shɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛ yɛ zɛnɔɔtɔ u ɔ̃ a vini kpai, u pɛli ko shɛ̃ɛ̃ vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn shɔpiyatɔ.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />A kɔsaanya a Ɗalapa a Kirisi Yesɔ ɗekɨn, shɔgbeteu yɛ yeeri shɔu a suruni ruu a shɔgbeteyi vɔtɛyɛni, aruviya yɛ sɔɔtɔ u ɔ̃ kpati a kopiya yuu, n gakɔɔtɔ <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />a nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubiitɔ, a yɛ ɗekɨn a nwanɛni; ko shɔ kasi ntanɛtɛ ko shɔ ji kasi ntanɛ ɓa, a geli shɔtɔ naa i vipɛlinɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ kɔ̃linɛyɛ, a geliyi nɛi yaa pɛlinɛtɔ, shɔgbeteyi pɛlivi tɔ̃vɨn a masibiitɔ, mati shɔ vi atette sisɨnmɛɛnɛ kpai. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Aruviya ɗaa kaanɛ gbete shɔzɛyi i wesho tɔɓa a vimatinɛ tɔ̃vɨn ni ɓa, ama i yɛ kã ɓɛɛ jo vimati kɔ̃linɛ gbete i kasiyɛ, i yɛ toli ɓɛɛ jo shɔmala waanɛ ai ɗɔbii, shɔgbeteyi yɛ geliyi vigbeteyi sho kasi ntanɛyɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Shɔzɛyi i yɛ wesho tɔɓa aɗɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn ntanɛni ɓa, i wesho kɛ aɗɔ ruuɓereyi wezeyi ntanɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Ama ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ mɔkɔ Timoti a sã a yuutɔ a vi piti kpaini; a mɛɛsisɨntɔ akɛ ɓooraanɛyɛ, a nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨntɔ, a pɛli vishonɛ gbete Ɗalapa ã yɛ naa pɛlitɔ kpai naa Ɗalapa jashonɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Aruviya n ɗaa pɛlitɛ gbete shɔ yɛ nyoyɛ, n yɛn ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔ ɓa n vɔkɛtɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />N yisinya vishonɛ gbete Kirisi Yesɔ ãyɛ nɛn pɛliyɛtɛ, n sɔ̃ri nyayisinɛtɛ n pɔ̃ ruu tɔ̃vɨn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛtɛ, <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa pɔ̃sin vigbete nɛn ãng-yɛtɛ a kolapa aru gbete n ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn a Ɗalapani yɛ, shɔgbeteu yeeruu tɔ̃vɨn, Uɓeyelapa yɛ ãng-yɛ a leeuni, ɓa nkɔng sheeli ɓa ama a shɔgbeteyi i yɛ gauyɛni piti kpai nɛu shɛyɛ atette ɔrinɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">N Ruu Nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Timoti pɛli nɔgbete a pɛliyɛ a ang ɗɔbii tɛ̃ɛ̃ti <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Aruviya Demas ɔri vi kotimtɔ, yaantɛ yɛtɛ Tasaloniya. Kirzen yɛtɛ Galantiya, Titu yɛ sɔ̃njo Dalmatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka kɔ sheeli a nkɔni. A kã Marku a arɛ awuni aruviya yɛ pɔ̃siunaatɔ a vishonɛni. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />N sho Taikiku tɛ yɛnɛ Afisa. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Naa a kaanɛ a n ting fãrã sɔrɔ gbete n yaa a Karbu naa a Turuwasa naani, a n ting laabeeneyi sɔ̃njo, badijo koo gbete shɔ tɔ̃ri aa kovivaa.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alezanda shɔ vishonɛ lasaa kulinnɔɔtɛ fɛ̃ɛm; Uɓeyelapa yɛ tasiu raatɔ ayuu vikɔ̃linɛ gbete pɛlinyɛni. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Mɔkɔma a kɔyuutɔ a yuuni aruviya masiyatɔ fɛ̃ɛm au ruu gbeteu shanɛni.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />A ɗekɨn gbete n shi ang yuuyɛ a shɔ ruuyeenɛyi ɗekɨn; shɔwɔ ji sha nya wɔ tɔ̃vɨn ɓa ang yuuni ɓa. Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa u yaasi ruuvinitɔ aru gbeteyi i ji shi ɓa ang kɨnti ni ɓa! <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ama Uɓeyelapa u si a nkɔni a ãng kakarɛ, nɔgbete ang kabiikɔ n nwari shɔ Yahudawayi ruum piti kpai i ntarɛ; a raanrɛ a nɔgbete shɔ si nyon vɔrɔyɛni. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Uɓeyelapa yɛ raantɔ a vikɔ̃linɛ shɔpiya naani u tunrɛ n ting u ɗɔ kpati roonɛ a kolapa. Bassinɛ u ɔ̃ au bikɔ dangdang! Nankɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyageenɛ Dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />A geerin Briskila nya a Akila ni, wɔsɔ̃n Onesiforu wɛrɛni kpai. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Arasitu u ɔ̃nɛ a Koranti, n yaa Turofimu a Miletu aru u si pɛ vɔrɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Goosi ɓɛɛ pɛlinɛ a pɛli nɔgbete a pɛliyɛ a aɗɔnrɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Yubulu a Fuden, a Lainu, a Kalaudiya, a gãsi shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyini i gee ɔ nyatɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Uɓeyelapa u ɔ̃ awɔ suruni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ u ɔ ɔkɔɔni kpai.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>